  "contentHtml": "\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Indian tadka bursts to life with hot oil and dancing spices that wake up any dish in seconds. Mustard seeds pop like tiny fireworks beside cumin and nigella, while chopped garlic, ginger, and red chilies swirl in a golden pool of ghee. Curry leaves and a pinch of asafoetida join in, sending rich, savory fragrance drifting through the kitchen. A squeeze of fresh lemon juice adds bright lift and ties every flavor together. In just minutes, indian tadka turns simple rice, dal, or vegetables into a lively celebration of spice and aroma you will want to make again and again.</p>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-rank-math-toc-block\" id=\"rank-math-toc\"><h2>Table of Contents</h2><nav><ul><li><a href=\"#why-youll-love-this-indian-tadka\">Why You’ll Love This indian tadka</a></li><li><a href=\"#ingredients\">Ingredients</a></li><li><a href=\"#how-to-make-indian-tadka\">How to Make Indian Tadka</a></li><li><a href=\"#recipe-snapshot\">Recipe Snapshot</a></li><li><a href=\"#pro-tips-for-making-indian-tadka\">Pro Tips for Making Indian Tadka</a></li><li><a href=\"#how-to-serve-this-indian-tadka\">How to Serve this indian tadka</a></li><li><a href=\"#make-ahead-and-storage\">Make Ahead and Storage</a></li><li><a href=\"#fa-qs\">FAQs</a></li><li><a href=\"#final-thoughts\">Final Thoughts</a></li></ul></nav></div>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"why-youll-love-this-indian-tadka\"><strong>Why You’ll Love This indian tadka</strong></h2>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>Transforms any dish into a flavor explosion.</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Quick and easy to prepare, perfect for busy days.</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Versatile seasoning for lentils, vegetables, and more.</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Brings authentic Indian flavors to your kitchen.</li>\n</ul>\n\n\n<div id=\"wprm-recipe-container-7912\" class=\"wprm-recipe-container\" data-recipe-id=\"7912\" data-servings=\"4\"><div class=\"wprm-recipe wprm-recipe-template-meadow\"><div class=\"wprm-la